Note before sending: the DPDP Act's rights provisions take effect as the DPDP Rules commence, which happens in phases. Check which rights are in force on the date you file. Section 12 is framed around personal data processed on the basis of consent; whether and how it covers content uploaded by a third party is a question for your lawyer. Draft 1 (IT Rules) does not depend on this.

